      "writtenOn": "2023-05-04T20:10:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The doc you pointed to doesn\u0027t include information on dependency chains. This one (https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BLivopEPewNYiipx2dulx9cYvlZoBn8mqUO9b-f5RNI/edit#heading\u003dh.qj2avam5o6vs) does, but the instructions seem outdated: repo is never referenced, all branches are created on git. Can one of you provide a reference that matches \"the way this is (actually) done throughout ChromeOS\"?",
      "parentUuid": "94305b51_36a9de1b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "f4827d872ccda8f0a934354d9040a64fad997ae7",
